Output docs/lampa.gif

Require target/debug/lampa

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "GruvboxDark"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Framerate 30

Type "OPENAI_API_KEY=demo target/debug/lampa"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "Remember that the release color is blue."
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
